 "remarks": "6 Down River pairs new construction with privacy and walkability - the scale of a single-family home, without the maintenance. Built in 2024 and further refined in by the developer in 2025, this 4-bedroom residence offers over 3,000 square feet across four finished levels, conceived for an effortless lock-and-leave lifestyle. The main level is open and light-filled, built for entertaining: the kitchen with custom cabinetry, high-end appliances and a large center island connects seamlessly to dining and living areas anchored by a gas fireplace and bar. Upstairs, the primary suite includes a spa-like bath and generous walk-in closet, alongside two well-proportioned bedrooms, additional baths and a laundry room on the same level. The finished third floor delivers a fourth bedroom - suited to a home office, bunk room, or playroom. What sets 6 Down River apart: Finished third floor - fourth bedroom, office, bunk room or play space. Finished lower level - recreation area with a glass-enclosed gym or office Private terrace and lawn. Attached 2-car garage     A move-in-ready path to newer construction, minutes to the village and the train.",
